the Treasure Room.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Loot value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Negotiable</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>(not bought by NPCs)</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>(not sold by NPCs)</p></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">6.1<br/>December 23, 2000<br/>Christmas Update 2000</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Keys <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-key-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>This opens a door near the armory in <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>, providing access to get <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203802\">Key 3802</a>. Also opens the door south of <a href=\"#/wiki/Emperor%20Kruzak\">Emperor Kruzak</a> leading to the Kazordoon Treasure Room. Past the door several <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Guard\">Dwarf Guards</a> spawn in this room.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Keys\">Related Keys</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Copper_Keys\">Copper Keys</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li>Key 0001</li><li>Key 0020</li><li>Key 0022</li><li>Key 0101</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203012\">Key 3012</a></li><li>Key 3015</li><li>Key 3100</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203142\">Key 3142</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203301\">Key 3301</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203303\">Key 3303</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203800\">Key 3800</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203802\">Key 3802</a></li><li>Key 3803</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203899\">Key 3899</a></li><li>Key 3900</li><li>Key 3901</li><li>Key 3902</li><li>Key 3909</li><li>Key 3910</li><li>Key 3911</li><li>Key 3912</li><li>Key 3913</li><li>Key 3914</li><li>Key 3915</li><li>Key 3916</li><li>Key 3917</li><li>Key 3923</li><li>Key 3925</li><li>Key 3930</li><li>Key 3931</li><li>Key 3932</li><li>Key 3933</li><li>Key 3934</li><li>Key 3935</li><li>Key 3936</li><li>Key 3937</li><li>Key 3938</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203940\">Key 3940</a></li><li>Key 3988</li><li>Key 4210</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204501\">Key 4501</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204502\">Key 4502</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204503\">Key 4503</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204601\">Key 4601</a></li><li>Key 7772</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["emperors-cookies-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"emperors-cookies-quest","quest":"Emperor's Cookies Quest","step":"1-0","n":4,"title":"Abrir a pequena sala","kind":"reward","coords":[]},{"slug":"emperors-cookies-quest","quest":"Emperor's Cookies Quest","step":"2-1","n":6,"title":"Abrir a porta das casernas","kind":"reward","coords":[{"x":32601,"y":31927,"z":6,"label":"Casernas (porta da Key 3801)"}]}]}}